  "api_recipes": {
    "stored": "ModelRead::resource_record/query(Query::Resource)/inspect/value and schema.identity(actual); reciprocal authored containment plus actual ReferenceView::Resolved(resident_handle). Qualified names label actual graph IDs, never replace a resolver.",
    "selector": "Use Schema::effective_feature(actual,field) canonical owner/identity/Feature in SAME scoped StructuralValueSelector::select. Require Some, resident source-qualified returned IDs and absent aliases; do not materialize computed data.",
    "invocation": "instantiation_reads::native_invocation_instantiated_type(genuine_owner,store,object,budget). Ordinary stored first non-FeatureMembership target; no invocation execution. Full host needs current scoped genuine-owner handoff to call it directly.",
    "feature_type": "NativeAssociationTypeStructuralValues::get_type reuses bound private admitted roots and shared NativeTypeGraph. Full NativeCohortServices currently exposes structural/snapshot traits only; add narrow language-owned callback, no ResourceRecord-to-authority rebinding.",
    "usage_reference": "Existing source-bound UsageReferenceSettings::DerivedValues requires actual ComputedSettingContract. Not currently composed as prepared semantic-read/full cohort selector; no host !isComposite substitute.",
    "arithmetic": "KerMLCurrentReads current-text native_operator_signature supports14 DataFunctions binary families; evaluate_root_integer supports selected EInt +/* root Features. No broad same-ResourceSet evaluator facade.",
    "validator": "K01ValidationSlice lists 42 applicability rows; only physical checkElement/checkImport are implemented in this slice. language_validated and publication_permitted remain false."
  },
